/-!
# KFW: frames of run-time registers around uniform programs

* `σPush σ l`: the register assignment after pushing the values `l` (last push wins);
  `agree_pushSt'`: pushing keeps the background in agreement.
* `PushSeq σ pl vl c`: the pushes `pl` (expressions evaluated **sequentially**, each under the
  registers after the earlier pushes) push the values `vl`, at cost `≤ c`; `Sp.pushSeq`.
* **`sImplQ_push`**: push a frame, run a uniform `SImplQ` program on the extended background, pop.
* `sImplQ_call`, `sImplQ_ite`: procedure calls and register tests.
* `SImplQ.mono_dw`, `sImplQ_subOp`, `sImplQ_equiv`, `sImplQ_skip`: bookkeeping.
-/

